<div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose about">
  <p class="lead">The place you send a friend who just asked, "wait, Black Lotus is legal?"</p>

  <h2>Who runs it</h2>
  <p>Players, in our spare time. The site is free and ad-free.</p>

  <h2>The official word</h2>
  <p>The rules and the points list belong to the Canlander Council at <a href="{{ site.official.home }}">canadianhighlander.ca</a>. They always have the final word. Canlander.org is an independent fan site.</p>

  <h2>Want to help?</h2>
  <p>Spotted a broken link or have something to add? <a href="{{ site.issues }}">Open an issue on GitHub</a>.</p>

  <h2>Thanks</h2>
  <p>To the Victoria players who started this in 1999, to <a href="/council/">the council</a>, and to everyone running weeklies, recording podcasts and logging results.</p>
</div>
